(text "1  Single 12 V supply PS1 feeds the I/O board; on Build A the I/O board passes 12 V to the Jetson (9-20 V input).\n2  The ReSpeaker is powered over W3; its LM48511 amplifier drives LS1 (4 ohm minimum load).\n3  W2 joins the I/O board to the SBC header pin-for-pin; only pins 1, 15, 29, 31, 32 and grounds are used.\n" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 220.98 195.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8827e688-33a9-5510-a434-c228b83d1945"))
